Package: zyphor-debian-handler
Version: 1.0.0-r1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Mark Jason Espelita <markjasonespelita@gmail.com>
Depends: bash, apt, dpkg, pkexec | policykit-1, zenity, libnotify-bin, xdg-utils
Description: Debian package handler for Zyphor OS
 Installs Debian packages (.deb) by double-clicking them in the file
 manager.
 .
 A confirmation dialog shows the package name, version and description,
 then the package is installed with apt (so dependencies are resolved
 automatically) after a graphical administrator authentication prompt.
